# Records the scan root the graph was built from, for `graphify update`. Listed
# explicitly (the line above already covers it) because it is tempting to commit
# so the scope travels with a clone - it can't: it holds an absolute path. The
# intended scan root is documented in CLAUDE.md instead.
graphify-out/.graphify_root

